# Rust
target/
Cargo.lock
# One workspace, one lock — and this one is tracked, because the repo ships two
# binaries (erno-cli, erno-monitoring) alongside the library. The blanket ignore
# above still covers any project scaffolded into the tree by `erno new`.
!/Cargo.lock

# IDE (consider moving editor-specific patterns to ~/.gitignore_global)
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
*.log

# Database
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Test artifacts
coverage/
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Angular build cache
.angular/
